SUMMARY:Thirsty Thursday - Malvern Tavern - 5km
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Maria Crawford\n\nMeet at the Malvern Tavern on Belmont
  Road. \nRun will be approximately 5km and we'll aim to cover it in around 
 40-45 minutes. Any hills will be walked or jeffed and no one left behind.\n
 \nThis run is aimed at recent and previous TF cohorts\, folk returning from
  injury and anyone who fancies a social\, chatty run.\n\nPlease wear high v
 iz and bring a torch so we can be seen.\n\nOptional post run drink in the M
 alvern Tavern afterwards!\n\nPlease remember to click out if you can no lon
 ger make it.\n\nMaria (covering for Sarah)\n[Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView
  on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/34678317218623
 39418\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Sat\, 14 Mar @ 11:01 PM
